{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56460","headline":"灵草歌 合穗草 · 白云仙人","name":"灵草歌 合穗草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天降神柜草，无过访合穗。\n烧药实堪夸，不与凡草揆。\n衆草经霜软，此草不憔悴。\n寒暑不相侵，烧药添智慧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白云仙人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56460.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56460","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}